  "why": "project_incremental seeds FIRe from the cached model, so a `regraded` event in the new half that supersedes a grade the prior half already folded never reaches FIRe. 1.0 documents this and routes such a stream down the full-replay path (service.py:272 -- a Regraded event or a projector_version mismatch, and nothing else). A profile_reset is the second class: finalize drops the reset topic's default state, so the resume stops propagating onto it, and service.py:272 leaves such a stream on the incremental path. The port must diverge at the SAME splits and to the SAME model in both classes."
